    <tr>
      <td width="582" valign="top" height="0" bgcolor="#808000">
        <font face="Impact" color="#FFFFFF" size="5">July 10th, 2000 News</font>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="582" valign="top" height="0">
        Well, the everquest gathering was a very interesting experience.  I'm glad that a lot of<br>
        people from the guild came, namely the Daggerdave family.  It was fun and very exciting to<br>
        finally put a face behind the "pixel-type mask".&nbsp;<br>
        <br>
        Some interesting news that was announced in the meeting.  Brad McQuaid announced that&nbsp;<br>
        there will be a third expansion based on the continent Velious.  He said that the expansion<br>
        will have white dragons, ice giants and other cold weather based monsters.  The expected<br>
        release of this interesting expansion will be December of THIS YEAR!  Also as a bonus, it<br>
        is expected that the current character graphics will be upgraded!<br>
        <br>
        To see what we experienced at the gathering, there are pictures that I took during the&nbsp;<br>
        meeting.  You can find them at the Photo Album area of the web page under (EQG3).<br>
        <br>
        Cid&nbsp;
        <p>(Back from EQG3..)</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="582" valign="top" height="1" bgcolor="#808000">
      <font color="#FFFFFF" face="Impact" size="5">June 15th News</font>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="582" valign="top" height="0">
        <font face="Arial" size="2">Nothing much to report.</font>
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">Guildmembers level 20-30ish can join
        Daisey, Runningwolf and Gruemash at Cazic Thule.&nbsp; Give them a shout
        if you need a group.</font></p>
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">A note to all people that are going to
        Las Vegas:</font></p>
        <p><font face="Times New Roman" size="2">I will be getting the shirts next week for all of the Divine Wind<br>
        people that are going to Vegas.<br>
        <br>
        Please let me know:<br>
        1) if you are going for sure<br>
        2) your shirt size for a man's golf style T- Shirt<br>
        3) your favorite color (only one Brotherwolf and Daisey)<br>
        4) the character name you want on the shirt, for those that<br>
        have more than one character they play often (character has to<br>
        be in the DW guild).<br>
        <br>
        We will be putting character names along with guild name and server<br>
        name on the left pocket area (no pocket on the shirts).&nbsp;<br>
        The shirts are going to be a light heather gray and are a&nbsp;<br>
        "full cut" (generous proportions).<br>
        <br>
        I know I have gotten info from most or all but I just want to make<br>
        sure before I buy them.<br>
        <br>
        Thanks....I can't wait to meet you all in person!<br>
        <br>
        Ladie</font></p>
        <pre><font face="Arial" size="2">Please Inform her about this information ASAP by either <a href="mailto:daggerdave@divinewind.org">E-Mail</a> or tell.</font></pre>
      <p>&nbsp;
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="582" valign="top" height="2" bgcolor="#808000">
