        comments, or see any errors, don't hesitate to <a href="mailto:cidani@divinewind.org">contact</a>
        me!</font>
        <p><b>A Message from Daggerdave:</b></p>
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">Just to let you know guys and gals,
        Windfyre's account is being acquired by Rainn.</font></p>
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">Also a friendly reminder, we HEAVILY
        encourage people to sign up for the mailing list, that<br>
        is how I will be communicating about the Fear raid and all the other
        things<br>
        coming up.</font></p>
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">Also, if you have any screenshots,
        character pics, or your character info needs to be updated, PLEASE email
        <a href="mailto:cidani@divinewind.org">Cidani</a> ASAP.
        </font>
